{"src":"en","tgt":"it","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"it","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7943.7524410000005,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8713.500004000001,"text":"La zona di Shenzhen, tuttavia, in questo senso funziona più o meno come un paese."},{"kind":"audio","t":8802.353619000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8807.203361,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8812.375428000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8816.863616,"samples":30096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":15102.425055,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":15942.527369,"text":"Situata sulla cima di una delle montagne a nord della Mecca, la grotta si trova molto vicino"},{"kind":"audio","t":16026.607321,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16028.006508000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16029.531314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16031.120758000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":16031.488322000001,"samples":9328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":17736.301507,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18031.465772,"text":"isolata dal resto del mondo."},{"kind":"audio","t":18117.723749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18121.593737,"samples":28432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":26275.3317,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":27255.675276,"text":"Oggi le persone scrivono messaggi sulle schermate dei computer, senza mai dover avvicinarsi a un temperamatite."},{"kind":"audio","t":27350.107001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27351.607687,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27353.059213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27354.462721,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27356.151304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":27356.450089,"samples":9560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":37523.316151,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":38996.790516,"text":"I viaggiatori diretti in paesi con tasse elevate possono talvolta risparmiare una somma considerevole di denaro, soprattutto per prodotti come bevande alcoliche e tabacco."},{"kind":"audio","t":39101.741073,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39106.818521,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39112.224765,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39117.550339,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39122.739776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39128.023521,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39133.333906,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":39135.608429,"samples":18424,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":45773.518586,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46517.775898,"text":"Le piante producono il proprio cibo grazie al sole attraverso la fotosintesi. Forniscono anche ombra."},{"kind":"audio","t":46611.478115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46616.920978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46622.296132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46626.15165,"samples":27096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"audio","t":46695.269121,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46697.624524,"samples":20032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":58051.20013,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":59341.000792,"text":"L’ospedale ha seguito il protocollo di controllo delle infezioni, incluso il separare il paziente dagli altri per evitare possibili infezioni negli altri."},{"kind":"audio","t":59446.257024,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59451.259403000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59456.43306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59461.520059,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59466.682906,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59472.206657,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59476.332641,"samples":28992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":630},{"kind":"input","t":68162.793159,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":69433.437538,"text":"Il lavoro svolto è stato per lo più teorico, ma il programma è stato scritto per simulare le osservazioni effettuate sulla galassia di Sagittario."},{"kind":"audio","t":69533.971915,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69539.108233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":69544.072273,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":69549.321449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69554.774951,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":69560.202424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69563.092868,"samples":22992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":78291.24606800001,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":79522.74989400001,"text":"Le lingue ufficiali di Barcellona sono il catalano e lo spagnolo. Circa la metà preferisce parlare catalano, una stragrande maggioranza lo comprende e praticamente tutti conoscono lo spagnolo."},{"kind":"audio","t":79610.94702,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79616.411342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79621.890254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":79622.192209,"samples":6696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":79710.68643,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79715.811618,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":79720.882276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79726.307659,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79731.633124,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79736.323949,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":83784.936188,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":84771.789949,"text":"In alcune aree è sufficiente bollire l’acqua per un minuto, mentre in altre ne servono diversi minuti."},{"kind":"audio","t":84860.041863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84865.465906,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84870.600144,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84875.777471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84879.55265,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":89843.844342,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":90799.122019,"text":"Le piante sono al loro meglio in un ambiente naturale, quindi resistete alla tentazione di rimuovere anche solo un gambo."},{"kind":"audio","t":90892.524451,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90897.62636,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90902.722238,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90908.17317,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90913.486605,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90915.521402,"samples":18560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":97260.557267,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98531.680778,"text":"Negli anni ’20, l’atteggiamento prevalente della maggior parte dei cittadini e delle nazioni era quello del pacifismo e dell’isolazionismo."},{"kind":"audio","t":98632.232145,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":98637.591179,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98642.988563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98648.099191,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98653.556893,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98659.048625,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":98659.226852,"samples":7992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":103515.982089,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":104294.453402,"text":"Il Masa Serif era il predatore alfa del suo tempo, quindi non temeva nulla se non altri Mosul."},{"kind":"audio","t":104384.237292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104389.569957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104394.712254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104400.218646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104401.650613,"samples":15328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":113120.54555,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114279.043538,"text":"Fin dalla fondazione di Asunción nel 1537, il Paraguay è riuscito a preservare gran parte del proprio carattere e identità indigena."},{"kind":"audio","t":114382.879812,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114385.929873,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114389.389668,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":114392.64466600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114396.040051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114399.340518,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114402.781533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":114402.91691100001,"samples":7024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":119855.639308,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":120866.535643,"text":"La malattia è trasmessa dai maiali, i quali la trasmettono poi agli esseri umani attraverso le zanzare."},{"kind":"audio","t":120954.801358,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120958.072665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120961.152326,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120964.422433,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120967.010692,"samples":29128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":129343.741068,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130498.764701,"text":"La maggior parte dei telescopi per la ricerca moderna sono impianti enormi situati in aree remote con condizioni atmosferiche favorevoli."},{"kind":"audio","t":130611.84117700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130617.03420400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130622.22311100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130627.77005199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130633.09999599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130638.434451,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130640.537597,"samples":21192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":135211.837443,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":136200.179239,"text":"Le persone potrebbero non prevedere che la pazienza e la comprensione siano anch’esse necessarie per i viaggiatori."},{"kind":"audio","t":136291.46401499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136296.89053799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136302.16877299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136307.505178,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136312.67934499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":136313.566731,"samples":12560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":140529.559297,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141209.99745899998,"text":"È quindi probabile che la notazione sia stata aggiunta semplicemente come etichetta."},{"kind":"audio","t":141300.39026999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141305.88068099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141311.154736,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141315.77930099997,"samples":31296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":147759.125962,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":148385.31538999997,"text":"Ma ci sono molte cose sugli uccelli che sembrano ancora dei dinosauri."},{"kind":"audio","t":148469.07941699997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148474.36453199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148479.67917599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148481.13035199998,"samples":14496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":154943.79725099998,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":156031.196291,"text":"Sono quasi tutte spiagge sabbiose adatte per nuotare in sicurezza, e la maggior parte dispone di ombra fornita da"},{"kind":"audio","t":156132.318248,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156137.56369399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":156142.81696899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":156148.075104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156153.467717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":156153.784872,"samples":8360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":157892.90765699997,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158188.15102,"text":"Alberi Pohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":158272.252442,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158273.09036799998,"samples":11632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":164332.80642399998,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165409.38387899997,"text":"Duvall, che è sposato e ha due figli adulti, non lasciò una grande impressione su Miller, a cui fu raccontata la storia."},{"kind":"audio","t":165498.272963,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165503.488559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165508.893342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165514.375263,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165519.50936,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":165520.015372,"samples":10160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":175602.92901899997,"code":1005}]}